    title: "What a CAURD license actually means on a Bronx block",
    dek: "Conditional Adult-Use Retail Dispensary is not a vibe. It is the equity class New York built for justice-impacted operators — and the Bronx is where that sentence either becomes a storefront or a slogan.",
